    "title": "Invariant sets of input Lagrangians",
    "full_tex": "Let $A$ be a non-third-level normal form of \\textup{(\\ref{cert:block-form-clifford-classes})}, and let $D$ be a Clifford conjugate of one of the four gates $\\mathrm{CS}_{yz}^a\\CCZ^b$. If $X(D)$ is invariant under $J_A$, then $L_Z\\in X(D)$.\n"
